@host = http://localhost:3000

### Verificar saúde
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Buscar métricas
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard

### Buscar opções de clientes 
GET {{host}}/api/customers/options

### Buscar faturas
GET {{host}}/api/invoices

### Buscar fatura pelo identificador
GET {{host}}/api/invoices/183

### Buscar fatura por identificador indisponivel
GET {{host}}/api/invoices/99999

### Buscar fatura por identificador invalido
GET {{host}}/api/invoices/abc

### Criar fatura
POST {{host}}/api/invoices
Content-Type:application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "amount": 125037,
    "status": "pending",
    "issueDate": "2026-10-01",
    "dueDate": "2026-10-31"
}

### Atualizar fatura
PUT  {{host}}/api/invoices/184
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "amount": 125037,
    "status": "paid",
    "issueDate": "2026-10-01",
    "dueDate": "2026-10-31"
}

### Deletar fatura
DELETE {{host}}/api/invoices/187
